# XDG - State directories
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
# Shared team content (whitelisted — decisions, agents, workflows, skills).
# `.claude/*` excludes all contents; re-include the directory entry first,
# then the recursive `**` pattern. settings.json stays shared (whitelisted
# above). Pattern matches mahavishnu's allowlist style. Per
# oneiric/docs/adr/0001-deployability-discipline.md.
!.claude/decisions/
!.claude/decisions/**
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**
!.claude/workflows/
!.claude/workflows/**
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
# PR-1c: SessionEnd hook is part of the cross-repo merge-workflow infra
# (mahavishnu/.claude/hooks/agent-merge-on-end.py). settings.json is
# already whitelisted above. Track the hook so fresh clones ship it.
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/**
.session-buddy/
.skylos/
.crackerjack/
.superpowers/

